<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Synthetic bootstrapped pretraining<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>Correspondence to <a href="mailto:zitong@berkeley.edu" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">zitong@berkeley.edu</a></span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zitong Yang
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Apple  Stanford University  <sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">*</sup>Equal contribution 
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Aonan Zhang
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Hong Liu
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Apple  Stanford University  <sup id="id2" class="ltx_sup">*</sup>Equal contribution 
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Tatsunori Hashimoto
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
