<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10: </span>Performance comparsion with 200B tokens repeated twice vs. 400B unique tokens for the 3B model. We can see that the two models yield similar performance.</figcaption>
