<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Model Scaling</h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">An alternative approach to leveraging additional compute is to use a larger model.
In this section, we examine the benefits of fixing a training token budget, but using a 6B-parameter model (Table <a href="#A3.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ C.2 Model Scaling ‣ Appendix C Additional pretraining results ‣ Synthetic bootstrapped pretraining" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T11" class="ltx_table ltx_align_floatright" style="width:39%;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span>6B-parameter model setup.</figcaption>
<table id="A3.T11.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A3.T11.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T11.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A3.T11.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Total Params.</span></td>
<td id="A3.T11.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A3.T11.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3B</span></td>
<td id="A3.T11.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A3.T11.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">6B</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T11.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T11.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><math id="A3.T11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\text{context}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mtext>context</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\text{context}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A3.T11.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">4096</td>
<td id="A3.T11.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">4096</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T11.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T11.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.T11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{\text{vocab}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>vocab</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{\text{vocab}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A3.T11.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">49152</td>
<td id="A3.T11.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">49152</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T11.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T11.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.T11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{\text{layers}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>layers</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{\text{layers}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A3.T11.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">26</td>
<td id="A3.T11.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">32</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T11.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T11.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.T11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{\text{model}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{\text{model}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A3.T11.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">3072</td>
<td id="A3.T11.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">4096</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T11.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
